r-Alidoosti/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mr-Alidoosti/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mr-Alidoosti/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mr-Alidoosti/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/actions/runs/39627590236/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/actions/runs/39627590236/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/check-suites/107392189195","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/actions/runs/39627590236/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/actions/runs/39627590236/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/actions/runs/39627590236/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/actions/workflows/4608224","head_commit":{"id":"47909c264b81f4294696958fb70ed8fd3b299fef","tree_id":"948827821be1b16c02607e87e30e092d2666dd79","message":"Add mitigations for CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619\n\nOfficial PHP security advisory released on 21 Oct 2026 reports two critical\nunauthenticated Remote Code Execution vulnerabilities:\n\n1. CVE-2026-109618 (RCE via OOM corruption):\n   - Out-of-memory handling can interrupt PHP while internal request data\n     is only partially initialized.\n   - Mitigation: set 'memory_limit = -1' to avoid controllable PHP internal\n     OOM failure, with conservative 'post_max_size = 32M' and 'upload_max_filesize = 30M'.\n\n2. CVE-2026-109619 (RCE via stale global state):\n   - Request-owned internal state can survive after its backing memory has\n     been freed, allowing subsequent requests handled by the same worker\n     to reuse stale state.\n   - Mitigation: disable 'session.upload_progress.enabled = 0', and for PHP 8.5\n     set 'fatal_error_backtraces = 0'.\n\nRef: https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-21-5\nGHSA: GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w, GHSA-6wmf-4rv5-p3rp","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:35:15Z","author":{"name":"Mr.Alidoosti","email":"mr.alidoosti@wallex.net"},"committer":{"name":"Mr.Alidoosti","email":"mr.alidoosti@wallex.net"}},"repository":{"id":20040409,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkyMDA0MDQwOQ==","name":"wordpress","full_name":"docker-library/wordpress","private":false,"owner":{"login":"docker-library","id":7739233,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjc3MzkyMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7739233?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library","html_url":"https://github.com/docker-library","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/docker-library/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/docker-library/wordpress","description":"Docker Official Image packaging for WordPress","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker-library/wordpress/